{"type":"message","id":"1443f302","parentId":"229e39c2","timestamp":"2026-04-13T06:49:25.406Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"当前可用的 Skills 分为两类：\n\n## 📦 系统内置 Skills（/app/skills/）\n共 **73 个** 系统技能，包括：\n\n**文档处理类：**\n- `docx` - Word 文档处理\n- `pptx` - PowerPoint 演示文稿\n- `xlsx` - Excel 表格处理\n- `pdf` - PDF 文件处理\n- `official-doc-writer` - 党政机关公文生成\n- `nano-pdf` - PDF 处理\n\n**数据与分析类：**\n- `data-analyst` - 数据可视化与分析\n- `ask-data-in-natural-language` - 自然语言问数\n- `fetch-news` - 公司内部动态爬取\n- `contact-book` - 通讯录查询\n\n**保险业务类：**\n- `insurance-product-qa` - 保险产品问答\n- `customer-complaint-inspection-skill` - 客户投诉质检\n- `tender-bid-inspect-skill` - 招投标文件质检\n\n**工具类：**\n- `emailme` - 发送邮件到内部邮箱\n- `km-operation-prod` - 知识库文件上传/下载\n- `nickname-lobster-call` - 昵称管理\n- `understand-image` - 图片理解/OCR\n- `self-improving-agent` - 自我改进学习\n- `skill-creator` - 技能创建\n- `skill-vetter` - 技能安全审核\n\n**以及其他：** 1password, apple-notes, bear-notes, notion, obsidian, discord, slack, github, weather, spotify-player, sonoscli 等\n\n---\n\n## 📁 用户工作区 Skills（~/.openclaw/workspace/skills/）\n当前有 **1 个** 用户技能：\n- `imap-smtp-email` - 刚刚解压的 IMAP/SMTP 邮件处理技能\n\n---\n\n如需查看某个具体技能的详细说明，可以查看其 `SKILL.md` 文件。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"my-qwen-provider","model":"qwen35-397b-claw-normal","usage":{"input":23922,"output":424,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":24346,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1776062959218,"responseId":"chatcmpl-828975b1-d5ee-4027-bfcf-589e6dab7d24"}}
