{"type":"message","id":"7c3b6019","parentId":"4961426d","timestamp":"2026-04-13T06:51:49.481Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"好的，现在脚本在等待输入 IMAP 主机地址。由于您选择了自定义配置，我需要您提供以下信息：\n\n**请提供您的邮箱配置信息：**\n\n1. **IMAP 服务器设置：**\n   - IMAP Host (例如：imap.example.com)\n   - IMAP Port (通常是 993 或 143)\n   - 邮箱地址\n   - 密码/授权码\n\n2. **SMTP 服务器设置：**\n   - SMTP Host (例如：smtp.example.com)\n   - SMTP Port (通常是 465、587 或 25)\n   - 发送邮箱地址\n   - 密码/授权码\n\n**或者，如果您告诉我您使用的是哪个邮箱服务商（如公司邮箱、Gmail、163 等），我可以直接帮您填写常见的服务器配置。**\n\n您想手动输入配置，还是告诉我邮箱服务商让我帮您填写？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"my-qwen-provider","model":"qwen35-397b-claw-normal","usage":{"input":28346,"output":196,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":28542,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1776063104747,"responseId":"chatcmpl-da2f03a6-1606-4a40-ac60-2addb5593625"}}
